    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70792.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 115,
    "turn_text": "Well my instant reaction Chad was that Representative Angie Craig should step up and run for that seat. I think she would be a great successor to Senator Smith, and I'd like to see Steve Simon run for the governorship. Those are my first thoughts. I know there's some speculation about my interests, but I've made that pretty clear that my future will not be as a senator or governor for Minnesota, but we have some, I think, strong candidates and good folks willing to step up. And I think Angie would be a great, great successor for that seat.",
