    "turn_text": "Well, you use the word formal endorsements. I'm sharing with you my appreciation for both Steve Simon and Angie Craig. And I think they happen to be two of the people with whom I've worked in my faith, their principles. But most importantly, and you know, because we talk about this all the time, Chad, they're also courageous. They're willing to speak the truth, take some risk, and are not Part of the political machines, if you will, that I think are causing such destruction both on the right and left, that so many Americans are so tired of.",
