    "turn_idx": 123,
    "turn_text": "Well, Chad, as you often get me to do, I say things I feel that I'm not afraid. I've not spoken with either Steve Simon or Angie Craig about the respective roles. I'm simply sharing my perspective on who I think Democrats should both nominate support and hopefully win. So I think that's the best way to put it.",
