    "turn_idx": 124,
    "turn_text": "You talked about in your previous answer, something we've discussed a lot, your belief in hearing from the center, your belief in where the country really is going. When we approached the next time you have a chance to vote when you're back in Minnesota, will you still be a registered Democrat? By then, could you be an independent?",
