    "turn_text": "So let's talk about how younger individuals or individuals, maybe not as young as some might think, but new to politics, get in. Because you laid it out right now, seemingly the path to become an elected official, whether you're a Republican or Democrat. is to run to the extremes, to get the endorsement by moving to the left or moving to the right, and then following the marching orders of Donald Trump or following the marching orders of Alexandria Casio Cortez or Elizabeth Warren. That's not your politics. That's not the politics I'm drawn to. So how do we get individuals who are new to politics, who are more reflective of the majority of this country?",
